    {
      "severity": "major",
      "description": "MiMo Stoic targeted their own Thundertrap Trainer with Force of Will instead of targeting the opponent's Daze. This results in spending Force of Will (plus exiling a blue card and paying 1 life) to counter their own creature, wasting at least 3 cards (Force of Will, exiled card, and Thundertrap Trainer) for no benefit whatsoever.",
