      "decision_index": 26,
    },
    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Exiled Thundertrap Trainer (their backup Wizard and creature) instead of the more expendable Stern Scolding for Force of Will's alternative cost. Thundertrap Trainer is a key card that enables Flame of Anor's two-mode selection, and they have two Flame of Anors in hand. Stern Scolding is a narrow, situational counterspell that is the least valuable card to keep.",
