      "player": "Sonnet Vorthos",
      "decision_index": 28,
    },
    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "With the opponent at only 2 Islands and tapped out after spending Force of Will, this was a prime opportunity for mana denial. Playing Wasteland to destroy one of their Islands would leave them at 1 land with depleted resources, and with a second Wasteland in hand, could potentially lock them out entirely next turn.",
