    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Force of Will's flashback cost is {3}{U}{U}, which is extremely difficult to pay with only 2 lands on board. The alternate cost (1 life + exile blue card) cannot be used as a substitute for flashback costs. Stern Scolding's flashback cost of {U} would be immediately available and relevant in Legacy where many key creatures have power/toughness 2 or less.",
