      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Cast Ponder before playing a land. Should play Wasteland first (free land drop), potentially using it to destroy one of the opponent's tapped Islands to cut them to 1 land, then cast Ponder with the Island. Playing land before casting spells is fundamental sequencing - it preserves options and provides more information before committing mana.",
