    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "When ordering cards from Ponder, the player put Misty Rainforest on the bottom and Stifle on top. Given their hand of 2x Wasteland and 2x Swords to Plowshares with only 2 lands on board, they desperately need a land drop. Misty Rainforest is a fetchland that would both provide an immediate land drop AND thin the deck. Stifle is a narrow reactive card that doesn't address their current needs - they're behind on board with a Snapcaster Mage threatening them, and they need to develop their mana base to cast their Swords to Plowshares effectively while also deploying Wastelands.",
