    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Sonnet Vorthos has an untapped Wasteland and the opponent has no nonbasic lands (only two basic Islands), so Wasteland activation wouldn't help there. However, the player missed the opportunity to cast Swords to Plowshares on the opponent's Snapcaster Mage. Snapcaster Mage is a 2/1 that can attack and has already provided its ETB value, but removing it prevents 2 damage per turn and denies a potential blocker. More importantly, with the opponent having only 2 Islands tapped, this is a window where they can't counter the Swords (no mana available). Leaving the Snapcaster alive while having two Swords and an untapped Tundra is a missed opportunity to use a removal spell when the opponent is tapped out.",
