    },
    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "With Flame of Anor on the stack (likely choosing the draw 2 mode since there's no Wizard and no artifact/creature target worth hitting), MiMo Stoic should activate Prismatic Vista in response to thin the deck before the draw resolves. Additionally, fetching a basic land would protect against the opponent's two Wastelands.",
