    {
      "severity": "major",
      "description": "MiMo Stoic targeted the opponent with Flame of Anor's 'draw two cards' mode, giving the opponent two free cards instead of drawing them for themselves. With no enemy creatures or artifacts to target, drawing two cards for yourself was the only beneficial mode available.",
