      "description": "Fetched a basic Plains instead of a Tundra. With Murktide Regent in hand needing blue mana, and two Wastelands on their own board only producing colorless, having another blue source via Tundra would provide more flexibility. The reasoning even mentions wanting a basic Island but chose Plains instead.",
